        </p>

        <p>
            This is the short, human version. There is a
            <a href="/terms">longer version</a> that automated crawlers are
            served instead; it says the same things at greater length. If
            any wording here is unclear, the plain meaning wins over the
            long one.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Using the site</h2>
        <p>
            Browse the recipes, read the rituals, keep a Grimoire, cook
            from any of it. That's what the site is for and you're welcome
            to it, for yourself, for free. Don't try to break the site,
            overload it, or get into parts of it that aren't yours.
